---
import PageShell from '../../layouts/PageShell.astro';

const seoTitle = 'Editorial Policy | Med Spa Marketing Guide';
const seoDesc =
	'Transparency on sourcing, disclaimers, and why we abstain from medical directives, incentivized testimonials, or unverifiable benchmarks.';
---

<PageShell title={seoTitle} description={seoDesc}>
	<h1>Editorial policy</h1>
	<p>
		Our brief is education: repeatable workflows with explicit uncertainty. Editors bias toward HIPAA-aware tone,
		non-diagnostic narratives, and respect for clinician scope-of-practice.
	</p>
	<h2>Claims & evidence</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>Avoid inventing performance statistics, patient counts, or ranking screenshots.</li>
		<li>Prefer qualitative reasoning and falsifiable experiments over implied guarantees.</li>
		<li>Disclose when guidance is directional because laws, payers, and platforms shift.</li>
	</ul>
	<h2>Medical boundaries</h2>
	<p>
		Authors do not instruct dosing, candidacy decisions, or clinical protocols. Marketing copy must defer to
		licensed providers and regional compliance teams.
	</p>
	<h2>Review ethics</h2>
	<p>
		We discourage manipulative review schemes, undisclosed incentives, or language that pressures patients. Templates
		are drafts until counsel approves them.
	</p>
</PageShell>
